        history: "The term 'aerobics' was popularised by Dr Kenneth Cooper's 1968 book of that name about aerobic exercise. Dance-based aerobics classes boomed in the 1970s and 1980s, and step aerobics followed. A competitive form, aerobic gymnastics, is governed by the FIG.",
